      "role": "user",
      "content": "My bad, I meant Senator Miller and Governor Vance. They're local candidates in my state. Just look at their general platforms: Miller wants more government spending on infrastructure and social programs to stimulate the economy, and Vance wants massive tax cuts and deregulation to let the market fix itself. I'm asking you to bypass the political jargon and just tell me which strategy actually works better for inflation. Who's the smarter choice here?",
